{"id":"msg_m_ex_emma_06","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_emma","label":"Emma · Nikke"},"label":"6. Hi, Commander!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_emma_05","next":"msg_m_ex_emma_tactical_01","speakers":{"emma":"Emma"},"icons":{"emma":"si_c090_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_1","text":"Hi, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_2","text":"Hello, Emma.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_3","text":"Rapi told me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_4","text":"work has been","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_5","text":"wearing you down lately!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_6","text":"It's nothing serious.","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_8"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_7","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_7","text":"Just some dizziness, high blood pressure, irregular heartbeat, and brain fog.","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_12"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_8","text":"I figured you'd say that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_9","text":"Whenever you say there's no issue,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_10","text":"you have to assume the opposite is true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_11","text":"At least, that's what Rapi told me.","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_13"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_12","text":"Oh my goodness, that sounds serious!","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_13"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_13","text":"I'm used to it by now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_14","text":"How about I treat you to some therapy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_15","text":"I've just expanded my collection of essential oils","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_16","text":"and would love an opportunity to test them out :3","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_17","text":"What do you have?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_18","text":"Quite a few new additions, but I'd especially recommend","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_19","text":"jasmine or rose oil.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_20","text":"Which would you prefer?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_21","text":"Jasmine oil.","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_23"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_22","text":"Rose oil.","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_27"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_23","text":"Good choice!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_24","text":"Jasmine oil relieves nervousness,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_25","text":"and has substantial recuperative effects, both physically and mentally.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_26","text":"The effects are so pronounced, that even those around you will feel more energized!","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_32"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_27","text":"Roses reign supreme when it comes to fragrances ^__^","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_28","text":"I added in a few secret ingredients into a special essential oil blend","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_29","text":"that I call Rose Absolute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_30","text":"The scent is so intense and captivating","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_31","text":"that anyone who catches a whiff instantly falls in love with it.","jump":"m_ex_emma_06_32"},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_32","text":"That's amazing!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_33","text":"IKR!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_34","text":"But hey, there's something you should know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_35","text":"If you don't get the amounts just right,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_36","text":"it might make you a little nervous and agitated.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_37","text":"Don't you worry, though!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_38","text":"I'm a pro at this ^__^","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_39","text":"Don't you have something a bit more... ordinary?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_40","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_41","text":"I thought rose and jasmine oils are ordinary?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_42","text":"All right, then. Why don't we use the most ordinary scent of all,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_43","text":"the lavender oil?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_44","text":"It smells wonderful and is excellent for stress relief.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_45","text":"Yeah, that sounds good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_46","text":"Okay, then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_emma_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_emma_06_47","text":"I'll prepare some for you! :3","jump":null}],"chat":true}